title: No README sits at the repository's root, so a stranger on its front page is not told to open 'docs/README.org'.
pid: 1458e80e-bb80-4d56-a802-3bb019ebe37f
body: |2-
  Change: a root README of three lines: what skg is, in Jeff's sentence
  "Skg is software for manipulating and sharing knowledge.", and a link
  to 'docs/README.org'.
